Despite significant advancements in using AI for game content creation, certain challenges persist: 

1. What improvements can be brought to the process of creating game levels and environment and what impact will AI algorithms have on complicities, time and interference?
2. In what measures can the AI techniques applied in PCG, neural networks and reinforcement learning enhance the level of personalization of the content of the game? 
3. What are the current limitations that AI tools hold at the current gaming industry and how can the be tackled to enhance the efficiency of the game development processes?
